From 90daa65b2608f900df2ea0573cb9cb76e8886c38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:06:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash commands through backend
 execution

Selected-agent slash input uses the backend command path so provider-native commands such as Codex /status are executed as commands rather than prompt text. Codex resumes the existing thread with the slash command as an argument and registers the process so terminal interrupts can stop it.
